---
title: "Deployment Architecture"
---


flowchart TB

    INTERNET["Internet"]

    LB["Caddy"]

    K8S["Kubernetes Cluster"]

    GATEWAY["Gateway Pods"]
    SERVICES["Microservice Pods"]
    REALTIME["Realtime Pods"]

    DATA["PostgreSQL + Redis + NATS"]

    INTERNET --> LB
    LB --> K8S

    K8S --> GATEWAY
    K8S --> SERVICES
    K8S --> REALTIME

    SERVICES --> DATA
    REALTIME --> DATA